coi.reason = Reason
coi.disqualified.at = Disqualified on
coi.match.now = Now
coi.match.ended = No longer a conflict of interest
coi.match.still = Still a conflict of interest: {0}
coi.disqualify = Disqualify the selected files
coi.disqualify.help = Their votes are kept aside; "Distribute new files" never adds them again. This doesn''t change the round''s "Leave out conflicts of interest": its later distributions leave out new conflicts only if that is ticked.
coi.requalify = Requalify the selected files
